atom     containers/seq-preserves-count
source   generated
gen      gen/containers.raku
law      ({X}).Seq.elems  ===  ({X}).elems
why      reifying as a Seq changes the type, not the element count
ladder   14 spellings

- id     0001
  from   law:seq-preserves-count
  cell   1
  code   do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); (1).Seq.elems }
  same-as do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); (1).elems }

